@page "/spaces/{SpaceId:guid}/projects/{ProjectId:guid}/list"

@*
    A PROJECT'S LIST VIEW.

    ARRIVES LIKE EVERY SPACE-SCOPED PAGE, through SpaceArrival, exactly as the Board does: an unlisted Space is refused
    with no request, the active Space is asked first, nothing of the list renders before the server has answered, and
    every 404 renders the one refusal surface.

    THE ADDRESS HOLDS IDS ONLY (UX-DR33): the filters and the sort are this page's state, never the URL's, and no Status or
    Label name reaches the address or the document's title. Named TaskListPage so it cannot be confused with Space home's
    list of Projects (Components/ProjectList.razor).

    THE LIST ITSELF is TaskListView's, keyed on (Space, Project) so another Project starts a new list.
*@

<SpaceArrival SpaceId="@SpaceId" Context="arrival">
    <TaskListView @key="(SpaceId, ProjectId)"
                  SpaceId="@SpaceId"
                  ProjectId="@ProjectId"
                  OnRefused="arrival.Refuse" />
</SpaceArrival>

@code {
    /// <summary>
    /// The Space this route names.
    /// </summary>
    [Parameter]
    public Guid SpaceId { get; set; }

    /// <summary>
    /// The Project whose List View this is.
    /// </summary>
    [Parameter]
    public Guid ProjectId { get; set; }
}
